  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">ＴＯＴＯ株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
